  "title": "Courtney Kemp Reveals Power Doesn't Have Any Plans For California Version",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":514762,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/power-courtney-kemp-omari-hardwick-joseph-sikora.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-514762\"/><figcaption>Getty Images </figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At the end of season six of the original Power Series, Tommy Egan shared with his mother Katie Egan and Spanky that he was headed to California. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"Starting a new organization in a new place,\" <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m-CyaTj-0UU\">said Egan</a>...</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Spanky: Yeah, you going somewhere?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tommy: I'm thinking about it!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Spanky: Where are you going? </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tommy: You really want to know? </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Spanky: Come on now, you know you gotta tell me.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tommy: Alright, I'll tell you, but then I have to kill you. California!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m-CyaTj-0UU\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m-CyaTj-0UU\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Well, last week, Courtney Kemp was on Instagram Live for her weekly Q&amp;A recap with the fans. During the Live, she shared that Power will not be featured in LA. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"No, we are not planning to do a Los Angeles version. We were going to than the Tommy Version ended up being in Chicago,\" <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WaWajJASOhs&amp;t=1556s\">said Kemp</a>.<gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WaWajJASOhsu0026t=1556s\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WaWajJASOhs&amp;t=1556s\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> Power Force will make its much-anticipated debut on Sunday morning at 9 pm EST after the season finale of Ghost on Starz. So, make sure you tune in. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
